SO!

SPOILER ALERT!

Get a few cursed scrolls of genocide and a few blessed scrolls of taming.  
Read a genocide to bring in leprechauns, and immediately tame them.  Do this
a few times.  Make sure they're happily fighting (and use telepathy to make 
sure that bad dudes don't kill them), and leave the immediate vicinity, but
stay on the level.  I'm not sure what happens, except that I see them stealing
gold from each other.  In about 2000 rounds, I happened on several piles, 
ranging in size from $30,000 gp to $110,000 gp.  I guess that's the trick.

